msgid "Active weekend rate"
msgstr "Wochenendtarif aktiv"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:532
msgid ""
"Only grips with exactly the right start/return weekday and exactly the "
"following duration (e.g. Friday to Monday = 3 rental days)."
msgstr ""
"Greift nur bei exakt passendem Start-/Rückgabe-Wochentag und genau der "
"daraus folgenden Dauer (z. B. Freitag bis Montag = 3 Miettage)."

